---
import ArticleCard from "./ArticleCard.astro";
import LoadingStateIndicator from "./LoadingStateIndicator.astro";
---

<section class="w-full max-w-[720px] pt-8 md:pt-12 px-6 md:px-12 pb-24">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 md:gap-16">
    <ArticleCard
      title="Building a Concurrent Web Server in Rust: A Brutalist Approach"
      description="Exploring the raw primitives of threading and asynchronous I/O in Rust
          without relying on heavy frameworks. We examine the standard library,
          mutexes, and channel communication to serve thousands of requests with
          minimal overhead."
    />

    <ArticleCard
      title="Notes on Distributed Systems Architecture"
      description="A collection of heuristics and architectural patterns for scaling
          systems across multiple geographic regions. Focusing on eventual
          consistency, vector clocks, and gracefully degrading under partition
failures."
    />

    <ArticleCard
      title="Vim as an IDE: The Minimalist Configuration"
      description="Stripping away bloated plugins to rely on native Vim features. A deep
          dive into LSP integration, native netrw for file exploring, and
leveraging the quickfix list for seamless compiler integration."
    />

    <LoadingStateIndicator />
  </div>
</section>
